# Drafted by Gemini (R21 roads), edited.

~ attempt
Narrator: You set your boots toward the edge of the village, where the cart-track ought to run out into the dark moor.
if not flag.fd_church_found
-> first
elif flag.roads_failures >= 3
-> offer
else
-> try
endif

~ first
Narrator: The lane bends round a row of grinning lanterns, then bends again, and sets you down before a shuttered church door with no sound at all behind it.
set fd_church_found
move fd_silent_church:from_festival
-> END

~ try
Narrator: Strings of red and yellow bunting sway across the ditch ahead, and the smell of hot lard and scorched sugar hangs thick over the ruts.
* [Survival DC 20] Find the true road out -> escape | escape_fail
* [Investigation DC 20] Study the loop for the seam -> escape | escape_fail
* Turn back -> END

~ escape
Narrator: Between two painted posts {name} spots a gap in the bunting where the reed-pipes thin to nothing. Beyond it lies the village at its ordinary size, while the festival waits behind you like a held breath.
set left_festival
set fd_away = 1
move wickermoor_village:default
-> END

~ escape_fail
Narrator: You walk hard for ten minutes by the stars, only for the hedgerow to curl back into the square, where the ribbon-dancers wave their greasy hand pies in welcome.
set roads_failures += 1
if flag.roads_failures >= 3
-> offer
endif
move fd_festival:from_roads
-> END

~ offer
Narrator: A bladder-stick prods your elbow, and a smell of vinegar and sawdust rises from the cobbles.
chuckles [sly]: Leaving so soon, hip-hip-heroes? Sick-sick of poor Chuckles and his little games? Say the wordy-word and we can skip right to the grand parade!
* Yes, take us to the parade -> offer_yes
* No. -> offer_no

~ offer_yes
set parade_offer_taken
quest fools_day parade
chuckles [smile]: Wheee-hee! Strike up the brass, boys, the guests of honour are ready for their fun-fun!
move fd_festival:from_roads
-> END

~ offer_no
set roads_failures = 0
chuckles [sad]: Awww, spoil-sports! Back to the booths you toddle, then, until your little feet give out!
move fd_festival:from_roads
-> END
